Serving stack: SGLang (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang).
Speculative drafters trained with SpecForge (https://github.com/sgl-project/SpecForge).
DSpark extends DFlash (https://github.com/z-lab/dflash).

Some measurement scripts are shared with our sibling repository
https://github.com/karti-ai/qwen38-flash-next-spark and carry the same licence.

Serving-parameter starting points were informed by published GB10 recipes from
MiaAI-Lab (https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab) and by RadixArk's own model cards.
